    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mmultiscripts><mo>,</mo><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>1</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;be a given A.P. whose common difference is an integer and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the ordered pair <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to:",
